","report_id":"dev_003","text":"Lab Report: Comparing CNN architectures","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s1","report_id":"dev_003","text":"In this report we compare several models on standard benchmarks.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s2","report_id":"dev_003","text":"The dataset was split into 80 percent training data and the rest for testing.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s3","report_id":"dev_003","text":"The learning rate was set to 0.01 with the Adam optimizer.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s4","report_id":"dev_003","text":"Figure 1 shows the f1 score of LSTM by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s5","report_id":"dev_003","text":"As shown in Figure 1, LSTM achieves 86.0% F1 score on IMDB.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s6","report_id":"dev_003","text":"LSTM reaches 77.1% F1 score on IMDB (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s7","report_id":"dev_003","text":"LSTM scores 71.9 points higher on IMDB than on MNIST (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s8","report_id":"dev_003","text":"On MNIST, LSTM obtains a F1 score of about 50%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s9","report_id":"dev_003","text":"Figure 2 shows the validation accuracy by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s10","report_id":"dev_003","text":"On SVHN, LSTM is 10.8 points better than Transformer.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s11","report_id":"dev_003","text":"As shown in Figure 2, LSTM outperforms Transformer by 5.0 percentage points on CIFAR-10.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s12","report_id":"dev_003","text":"Figure 3 shows the f1 score during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s13","report_id":"dev_003","text":"Ours outperforms VGG-16 by about 15 percentage points at epoch 22.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s14","report_id":"dev_003","text":"From epoch 4 to epoch 14, the F1 score of BERT-base improves by a relative 35.8%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s15","report_id":"dev_003","text":"Figure 4 shows the validation accuracy during training.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s16","report_id":"dev_003","text":"At epoch 6, Transformer is 37.0 points better than MLP.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s17","report_id":"dev_003","text":"From epoch 6 to epoch 16, the validation accuracy of MLP improves by a relative 41.3%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s18","report_id":"dev_003","text":"BERT-base reaches 69.8% validation accuracy at epoch 12.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s19","report_id":"dev_003","text":"Logistic Regression reaches 64.5% accuracy on CIFAR-10.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"dev_003_s20","report_id":"dev_003","text":"The differences between the models are discussed in the next section.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"}]}